WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,980
My mother and her three daughters-in-law picked these up on the beach, right?

2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,580
That’s what’s so good about seaside life

3
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,340
As long as you work hard, you won't be hungry.

4
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,470
This pancake is a bit spicy

5
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,990
The dishes also lacked a little salt

6
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:14,150
Although I’m not used to it

7
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:15,430
However, the conditions are limited

8
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:17,750
You can only adapt to your mother first

9
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:21,070
Fat Girl said that her dried fish are all fried in oil

10
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,990
It tastes particularly delicious

11
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:25,060
A pound of oil costs more than one yuan.

12
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:26,180
Fat girls can afford it

13
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,540
It's because my father can make money by going overseas to provide childcare. Where's your father?

14
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,980
Your dad either drinks or plays cards.

15
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,980
Just be satisfied if you can eat steamed dried fish.

16
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:36,620
But the steamed dried fish doesn’t taste good, Dad

17
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,500
Can you go overseas and make money like Fat Girl’s father?

18
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,140
Everyone wants to eat fried dried fish

19
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,860
Ah Ya wants to eat too

20
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:54,770
Ah Ya also wants to eat rice and meat

21
00:00:54,770 --> 00:00:56,450
What should I do? There is no milk at home.

22
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:58,810
How about I make some more rice soup for her to drink?

23
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:00,810
Drinking rice soup all the time is not nutritious at all

24
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:03,770
Children under one year old must drink milk to grow

25
00:01:03,770 --> 00:01:07,460
We also made some money by replenishing Fish King during this period.

26
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:08,380
It's really not possible

27
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:09,940
Tomorrow I will go to the dock to look for Iron Rooster

28
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:12,180
Buy some sea chickens and fish for your lactation

29
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:14,100
Most families in the village go to sea

30
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:16,220
Almost no families go to buy sea chicken and fish

31
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:19,420
When the boat goes out, I'm afraid the big-toothed girl will make the whole village laugh.

32
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:21,020
Don't rush to spend money to buy fish.

33
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:22,220
Isn't the tide low in the early morning?

34
00:01:22,220 --> 00:01:23,140
I'm going to sea tonight

35
00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:24,460
See if you can hit it

36
00:01:24,460 --> 00:01:25,500
It doesn't matter if you can't hit it

37
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:26,460
If I hit someone else

38
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:27,580
Can also be exchanged with Tie Gong's family

39
00:01:27,580 --> 00:01:28,740
Don't think you said that

40
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:29,900
I will give you money

41
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:30,900
I don't want a dime

42
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:32,220
All you have to do is give me the keys to the boat.

43
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:34,260
Our fishing boat is a lottery wooden boat

44
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,260
No need to refuel

45
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:39,980
You can't drive it without the key.

46
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:41,460
In front of three ex-daughter-in-laws

47
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:42,820
If I were a mother

48
00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:45,020
They all showed a complete loss of confidence in their sons.

49
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:47,580
Then the three of them might look down on him even more.

50
00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:50,330
Still want to sneak away with the children?

51
00:01:50,330 --> 00:01:58,240
Then go try it, mother

52
00:01:58,240 --> 00:01:59,920
I will never betray your trust
